'''Snowball Fight Cave''' was a place of {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}} that was going to be made available to players for snowball fights during the frequently mentioned "Operation Mayhem" event using [[Frosty the Snow Cannon]] or [[Frosty the Snow Blaster]]. On November 30th 2022, this area was replaced with the [[Glacial Cave]].

